# suite TLOTSER
ok 1 - a lot controlled receipt must carry a lot
ok 2 - and the movement is not usable
ok 3 - the item master decides traceability, not the caller
ok 4 - a receipt that carries its lot is accepted
ok 5 - and the movement is usable
ok 6 - an issue of traced stock must say which lot
ok 7 - a lot that is not known is never assumed usable
ok 8 - missing shelf life data is not unlimited life
ok 9 - an expiry of 1 January 2025 is <n> days past
ok 10 - so the lot is not usable
ok 11 - ten days remain on the lot
ok 12 - ten days against a thirty day rule is a hold
ok 13 - 365 days remain on the lot
ok 14 - a lot with a year to run clears the minimum
ok 15 - an untracked item needs no lot or serial
ok 16 - an unsupported function is refused
ok 17 - a receipt registers a lot it has never seen
ok 18 - the lot row is on inv.Lot afterwards
1..18
# TLOTSER passed 00018 failed 00000
# exit 0
